  (text "AUTHORITATIVE for connectivity. Two parts on the MAIN board and one on the panel (ADR 0024 point 16, 2026-10-01:\nthe light pipe and the 0805 under it are gone).\n\n[UMBILICAL_POS12] The LT1641's output, not the analog +12 V: lit = the load switch is delivering, dark = toggle\noff or latched.\n\n[J-LED-PANEL] A JST B2B-XH-A on the main board's front face. LED-PANEL is a panel-mount indicator with NO\nfootprint: its leads are soldered to CBL-LED-PANEL, whose XHP-2 plugs in here - pin 1 the anode (LED_ANODE),\npin 2 the cathode (AGND_MOD). Its two nets are drawn to it through that lead.\n\n[AGND_MOD] The cathode returns on the main board's AGND_MOD. Where AGND_MOD meets PWR_GND and DIG_GND\nis dig-gnd-topology's question, not this sheet's." (at 154.94 38.099999999999994 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid cfa9face-4d19-5b26-a1b0-3f027f67247d))
  (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
)
